### Add marks
POST http://localhost:5083/api/marks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "studentName": "Arun Kumar",
  "registerNumber": "22CS101",
  "subject": "Mathematics",
  "marks": 85,
  "percentage": "85%",
  "grade": "A"
}

### Update marks
PUT http://localhost:5083/api/marks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "studentId": 1,
  "studentName": "Arun Kumar",
  "registerNumber": "22CS101",
  "subject": "Mathematics",
  "marks": 92,
  "percentage": "92%",
